// Title: Security Software Discovery - Linux
// ID: c9d8b7fd-78e4-44fe-88f6-599135d46d60
// Status: test
// Level: low
// Author: Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-19
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1518.001
// Description: Detects usage of system utilities (only grep and egrep for now) to discover security software discovery
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

_sourceCategory=* | where ((Image matches "*/grep" or Image matches "*/egrep") and (CommandLine matches "*nessusd*" or CommandLine matches "*td-agent*" or CommandLine matches "*packetbeat*" or CommandLine matches "*filebeat*" or CommandLine matches "*auditbeat*" or CommandLine matches "*osqueryd*" or CommandLine matches "*cbagentd*" or CommandLine matches "*falcond*"))
